# Gorilla 157 privacy cut
# D-157-33 satellite mode near-instant at 5 KB/s (maintainer, 2026-10-04): while a level is on, sites get Firefox for Android's identity (mobile pages; tick-box in Settings and the toolbar menu; per-site 'desktop version' from the toolbar button), the cache is kept across restarts, and Very slow link shows cached pages without re-checking (Reload fetches fresh).
